SUMMARY:TIRE AMNESTY DAY
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260919T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260919T140000
UID:d3a619cccf3a68a08880f087f03b77c5@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/5a24
 302/2147483647/strip/true/crop/612x792+0+0/resize/254x329!/quality/90/?url
 =http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd1%2Fed%2F970e63cf4d54acf1
 b9cbb81ac29f%2Ffall-tire-amnesty-day-2026.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by SPONSORING ORGANIZATION WASTE REDUCTION DISTRICT 
 OF MONROE COUNTY\nTIRE AMNESTY DAY\nWhat a nasty thing to come across when
  you’re hiking or driving down the road—dumped tires. Tires illegally 
 disposed of. However\, a variety of tires may be brought to the Waste Redu
 ction District’s Tire Amnesty Day. At the Fairgrounds\, September 19th. 
 The District offers waste tire collection for a minimal fee throughout the
  year but on September 19th you can dispose of accepted tires\, FREE. See 
 list of accepted and not accepted tires on wastereductiondistrict dot com 
 or call 812-349-2848. Tire Amnesty Day. At the Fairgrounds September 19th.
  \n # # #
LOCATION:Monroe County Fairgounds Gate #1\, 5700 W. Airport Rd\, Bloomingt
 on\, Indiana 47403
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/tire-amnesty-day-15-07-20
 26-09-38-25
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Heist
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260919T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260919T220000
UID:0dba2d063fbfd8cd21694819f9710d1c@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/ee9e
 49d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x2400+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F26%2Fac%2Fc466019b435c80
 77e8910448b3e1%2Fsq-heist-2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Constellation Stage + Screen\nConstellation Stage
  & Screen presents “Heist” on stage September 3-20 at the Waldron Audi
 torium.\n A band of criminals\, torn apart by suspicion and betrayal\, reu
 nites for one last job. The target: a multi-million dollar ruby owned by a
 n international jewel thief. When the plan goes sideways\, they slowly rea
 lize that when stealing from a thief\, there are no rules. Inspired by cap
 er films like Ocean’s Eleven\, The Italian Job\, and The Sting\, this hi
 gh-stakes thriller is packed with double-crosses\, disguises\, and daring 
 escapes.\n See Constellation’s website for more information\, including 
 a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at https://se
 econstellation.org/mainstage/heist/\nTickets: https://seeconstellation.org
 /mainstage/heist/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium\, 122 S Walnut St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 4
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/heist-24-08-2026-10-32-57
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
