BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LEGO® Friends Interactive Road Trip Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260919T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260919T180000
UID:6c27a8d7a7c30bbca3a149237815f734@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/0a32
 730/2147483647/strip/true/crop/936x624+0+0/resize/254x169!/quality/90/?url
 =http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3b%2F3e%2F117b44ff4b10b8c2
 3e6bf88fee35%2Fimage-3.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by The LEGO Group\nThe LEGO Group is bringing LEGO®
  Friends to life with an interactive road trip event series across the Mid
 west\, designed to spark imagination and community. \n The series of event
 s\, which made stops in Chicago and Minneapolis\, recreates the LEGO Frien
 ds Unicorn Dream Café\, a magical place where guests meet the LEGO Friend
 s characters and build in Heartlake City. The experience is designed as an
  interactive journey through the bustling city\, with moment after moment 
 of discovery\, play and connection\, and plenty of photo opportunities alo
 ng the way. \n As part of the experience: \n Kids meet the LEGO Friends th
 en head to the counter\, where they'll receive a Make & Take mini-doll and
  an additional build - just like ordering at a real-life café! \n Inside 
 the cafe-inspired play area\, they can explore an array of interactive Fri
 ends models\, arranged in the four different neighborhoods of Heartlake Ci
 ty (downtown\, fairgrounds\, residential streets and outdoor spaces). \n A
 t free-build tables\, guests add their own creations to Heartlake City\, b
 uilding their own stories into the world around them. \n Guests will recei
 ve the Heartlake Gazette\, an interactive newspaper with character activit
 ies and learning experiences.\nTickets: https://lego-r-friends-unicorn-caf
 e---indianapolis.appointedd.com/booking-widget/6a95962d890c492433105cfc
LOCATION:SPARK on Mountain Circle\, NE Quad - 1 Monument Cir\, Indianapoli
 s\, Indiana 46204
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/lego-friends-interactive-
 road-trip-series-14-09-2026-12-08-04
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
