BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"The Cook-Off" - Music by Shawn E. Okpebholo\; Libretto by Mark Ca
 mpbell
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260919T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260919T235900
UID:e3895c4fe73092a76f6e8c84ef88c1be@ipm.org
DESCRIPTION:The Cook-Off\nMusic by Shawn E. Okpebholo\nLibretto by Mark Ca
 mpbell\n WINNING RECIPE\n In this new opera\, chefs face off in a televise
 d cooking contest preparing one of America’s favorite comfort foods: mac
 aroni and cheese. But the ensuing tensions are far from comforting as the 
 cutthroat competition reveals deeper truths about food\, culture\, and his
 tory.\n Okpebholo\, named the 2024 Chicagoan of the Year in Classical Musi
 c by the Chicago Tribune\, partnered with Pulitzer- and Grammy-winning lib
 rettist Mark Campbell to create this 60-minute comic chamber piece. Twice 
 Grammy-nominated himself\, the composer’s work is distinctly contemporar
 y while rooted in tradition\, in a voice The Washington Post calls “fres
 h and new and fearless.”\n Commissioned by Chicago Opera Theater’s Van
 guard Initiative.\n Artistic Staff\nConductor\nLina Gonzalez-Granados\n St
 age Director\nMichael Shell\n Set Designer\nMark F. Smith\n Costume Design
 er\nElizabeth Licata\n Lighting Designer\nBridget Williams\n Video Designe
 r\nScott Carmichael\n Wig & Makeup Designer\nDrew Bryson\nTickets: https:/
 /am.ticketmaster.com/iumac/buy
LOCATION:Musical Arts Center\, 201 S. Eagleson Ave\, Bloomington\, Indiana
  47405
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/the-cook-off-music-by-sha
 wn-e-okpebholo-libretto-by-mark-campbell-01-09-2026-10-33-14
