DESCRIPTION:Presented by After the Storm Productions\nThe world premiere o
 f "Always a Little Bit Tipsy" will take place in Bloomington\, Indiana thi
 s September! Based on the topsy-turvy life of world-champion ballroom danc
 er and drag artist Tom Slater (a.k.a. Tipsy Teasedale) the all-new origina
 l musical\, "Always a Little Bit Tipsy"\, explores survival\, masculinity\
 , and the healing power of drag. This is a story about the violence of sma
 ll shames\, the masks we build to survive\, and the radical act of becomin
 g whole.\nTickets: afterthestorm.ludus.com
