UID:8f3c27434359b20076f0e9f7528745f0@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/b27c
 6c5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/640x360+0+0/resize/254x143!/quality/90/?url
 =http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdf%2F52c535214012a726
 1c5580a485fe%2Ffacebookeventbanner-aalbt-final.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by After the Storm Productions\nThe world premiere o
 f Always a Little Bit Tipsy will take place in Bloomington\, Indiana this 
 September! Based on the topsy-turvy life of world-champion ballroom dancer
  and drag artist Tom Slater (a.k.a. Tipsy Teasedale) the all-new original 
 musical\, Always a Little Bit Tipsy\, explores survival\, masculinity\, an
 d the healing power of drag. This is a story about the violence of small s
 hames\, the masks we build to survive\, and the radical act of becoming wh
 ole.\nTickets: afterthestorm.ludus.com
