 10c53b091ec987%2Fsaturday-market-info-3.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by People’s Co-op Market\nPeople's Co-op Market \n
 Weekly Saturday Market 10am to 2pm with Fresh Local Produce\, Artisan Vend
 ors\, Hot Food Vendors & More.\nSpecial events once a month. \n Share tabl
 e with veggies filled from our BIPOC farmers small farmers & LGBTQ & Lady 
 Farmers! Tons of seasonal veggies also coming from our very own Greenhouse
 !! $15 CSA bags & $5 eggs from our friends at Little by Little Farm.\n Buy
 ing from People's Market is a win win. You get amazing food & support Blac
 k & Brown farmers in Indiana who are under attack from discrimination and 
 disinformation campaigns that they do not exist! \nEach week we share comm
 unity and fun\, great conversations about growing food\, feeding our commu
 nity\, food sovereignty & eliminating hunger in Monroe County via growing 
 food! \n Come see us every week! \nOrder your $15 full basket CSA veggies 
 & $5 eggs from \n every week from Sat to Wed on our website: \nwww.peoples
 marketbtown.org \nOrdering a CSA every week is the best way to ensure you 
 get weekly abundance. Select delivery or pickup\n 10am to 2pm at First Uni
 ted Church in the Fellowship Hall 2420 E 3rd st. On the Eastside of Bloomi
 ngton IN\n People's Market is more than a market! Abundance in Mind & Soli
 darity with BIPOC Farmers in Action!\nWe strive for intersectional anti-ra
 cism in our market!
LOCATION:People’s Co-op Market\, 2420 E 3rd st\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4
 7401
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/peoples-co-op-market-week
 ly-market-07-07-2026-01-05-05
