DESCRIPTION:Presented by Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nAfter Acme products fail
  him one too many times in his dogged pursuit of the Roadrunner\, Wile E. 
 Coyote decides to hire a billboard lawyer (Will Forte) to sue the Acme Cor
 poration.\n A growing friendship between Coyote and Kevin motivates their 
 determination to win the court case\, as it pits them against Buddy Crane\
 , the intimidating boss of Kevin’s former law firm\, who now represents 
 Acme.\n Based on “Coyote v. Acme” by Ian Frazier\n Starring: Will Fort
 e\, Lana Condor\, Tone Bell\, John Cena\n Directed by Dave Green\nScreenpl
 ay by Samy Burch\n Rated: PG\nLength: 1hr 50mins\nFormat: DCP\nTickets: ht
