BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Celtic Thunder: Celebrate Your Favorite Songs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T220000
UID:4ad110f9d67610a9562d2da0e4c6964c@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/ff92
 fcb/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x566+0+0/resize/254x120!/quality/90/?ur
 l=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fef%2Fbd%2F24e6113f4f10928
 a79e3e9022b34%2Fceltic.png
DESCRIPTION:Captivating audiences across the nation\, Celtic Thunder is on
 ce again bringing their thrilling blend of tradition and innovation to Sou
 thern Indiana.\n Longtime fans will be thrilled to see their favorite voic
 es come together\, blending their remarkable talents in an atmosphere of w
 armth and nostalgia. Backed by the phenomenal Celtic Thunder Band\, the sh
 ow seamlessly weaves live music with captivating storytelling and immersiv
 e stagecraft.\n Support WTIU with a monthly gift of $15 and receive two ti
 ckets for the show Saturday\, September 26\, 2026\, at the Murat Theatre i
 n Indianapolis. Support WTIU with a monthly gift of $20 or more for two ti
 ckets to the show and a special soundcheck party with the band before the 
 show! Relive the magic of Celtic Thunder at this truly special evening!\nT
 ickets: https://indianapublicmedia.secureallegiance.com/wtiu/WebModule/Don
