 951dfa0eb6d7be%2Foct-4-run-for-the-animals-5k-1200-x-1200-px.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Monroe County Humane Association\nMonroe County H
 umane Association's 31st Annual Run for the Animals\, presented by The Dog
  House is a timed 5K run/walk at Karst Farm Park taking place on Sunday\, 
 October 4\, 2026. Each registration includes an official Run for the Anima
 ls t-shirt and sponsor swag. \n The 5K course starts at Karst Farm Park an
 d loops through the Monroe County Fairgrounds. The awards ceremony and spo
 nsor booths are now located near the start/finish line\, making it easier 
 for participants and families to celebrate together—and for faster resul
 ts posting! After the awards\, stick around for the raffles and fan-favori
 te pet contests! You don't have to be registered in the 5K to participate 
 in the raffle and pet contests! \n Event Schedule: \n Sunday\, October 4 \
 n 8:00 AM: Packet Pick-up & Onsite Registration Opens \n9:15 AM: Registrat
 ion Closes\, Trainer-led Group Stretch \n9:30 AM: 5K Run Begins \n9:35 AM:
  5K Walk Begins \n10:30 AM: 5K Run Awards Ceremony \n11:00 AM: Pet Contest
 s & Raffle Winners Announced \n We anticipate welcoming hundreds of runner
 s\, walkers\, and furry friends to this event! Don’t miss this great opp
 ortunity to support animal welfare in our community! \n For more informati
 on and to register\, visit monroehumane.org/5K.\nTickets: https://www.monr
 oehumane.org/5K
LOCATION:Karst Farm Park\, 2450 S. Endwright Rd.\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4
 7403
