 , 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, September 22\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, S
 eptember 29\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, October 6\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tu
 esday\, October 13\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, October 20\, 5:30-6:30 pm
 \n• Tuesday\, October 27\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, November 3\, 5:30
 -6:30 pm (Make-up session\, if needed\nTickets: https://pci.jotform.com/fo
 rm/262006259602148
LOCATION:The Arts Federation\, 638 North Street\, Lafayette\, Indiana 4790
