  Learn foundational ukulele skills and basic chords\n• Explore beginner-
 friendly songs and playing techniques\n• Learn the basics of music theor
 y\n• Build confidence playing the ukulele\n Instructor: Olivia Sutherlin
 \nOlivia Sutherlin is a multidisciplinary musician with a lifelong backgro
 und in\nthe performing arts\, including theater\, choir\, and band.\n Loca
 tion: The Arts Federation (638 North St\, Lafayette\, IN 47901) - Recordin
 g\nStudio\n Time: Tuesdays\, 5:30pm-6:30pm\nTuition: $150 (must be paid in
  full – this class cannot be taken on a week-toweek basis)\nFull Schedu
 le:\n• Tuesday\, September 8\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, September 15\
 , 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, September 22\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, S
 eptember 29\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, October 6\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tu
 esday\, October 13\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, October 20\, 5:30-6:30 pm
 \n• Tuesday\, October 27\, 5:30-6:30 pm\n• Tuesday\, November 3\, 5:30
 -6:30 pm (Make-up session\, if needed\nTickets: https://pci.jotform.com/fo
 rm/262006259602148
LOCATION:The Arts Federation\, 638 North Street\, Lafayette\, Indiana 4790
 1
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/adult-ukulele-class-04-08
 -2026-11-29-41
