 les\, comics\, stamps and coins\, and a big media section with DVDs\, CDs\
 , records\, and tapes all at great\, low prices. There will also be progra
 ms and food trucks throughout the week.\n Thursday\, October 15th\, 9am- 7
 pm – $10 Admission. Veteran’s Appreciation Day – veterans and active
 -duty military admitted free\, Monroe County Veteran’s Services info tab
 le. \n Friday\, October 16th\, 9am-7pm – FREE Admission. \n Saturday\, O
