SUMMARY:Dennis James Hosts Halloween
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261021T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261021T235900
UID:77089fa25dfc7adea7770124a780b2c7@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/26bb
 a59/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1080x1080+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fcf%2Fe08ba3fe441d84
 e3f7923ff5ec38%2Fdj-1080x1080.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by IU Auditorium\nBloomington’s favorite musical m
 astermind is back for his annual spooky spectacular. Dennis James returns 
 to the IU Auditorium pipe organ for a spine-tingling Halloween tradition t
 hat blends vintage thrills with live musical artistry. \n The evening will
  begin with a live radio-style re-enactment of the Inner Sanctum mystery 
 “The Vengeful Corpse\,” drawing audiences into a chilling tale of susp
 ense straight from the golden age of radio and starring student actors fro
 m IU’s Department of Theatre and Drama.\n James will then perform solo a
 s he provides his signature live organ accompaniment to two silent film co
 medy classics: Laurel & Hardy’s eerie (and hilarious) Habeas Corpus and 
 Buster Keaton’s clever caper The Haunted House. Equal parts spooky and s
 pirited\, this Halloween favorite delivers laughter\, nostalgia\, and just
  the right amount of fright.\nTickets: https://www.iuauditorium.com/events
 /detail/dennisjames-2026
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th Street\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 5
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/dennis-james-hosts-hallow
 een-05-08-2026-12-38-56
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
