 ance in the aisles to celebrate this cult classic in all its outrageous gl
 ory. Whether you’re a seasoned fan or a Rocky Horror newbie\, this is yo
 ur chance to throw toast\, toss toilet paper\, and fully immerse yourself 
 in the madness. Don’t dream it\, be there!\n Please note: The 7pm screen
 ing will include subtitles.\n Pre-Show Costume Contest & Devirginization:\
 n Join us 30 minutes prior to the screening\, at 6:30pm\, for our highly a
 nticipated pre-show event\, featuring a costume contest\, fabulous prizes\
 , devirginization ceremony\, and more!\n Prop bags are available as a $5 a
 dd-on purchase in advance or in the lobby before the show (while supplies 
 last)! Prop bags contain one everything you need for the ultimate Rocky Ho
 rror experience\, including: Newspaper\, Party Hat\, Playing Card\, Toilet
  Paper\, Rice\, Squirt Gun\, Noise Maker\, Rubber Glove\, Bells\, Toast\, 
 and a handy Audience Participation Guide.\n The Rocky Horror Picture Show 
 is Rated R\, recommended for mature audiences.\nTickets: https://buskirkch
 umley.org/events/rocky-horror-picture-show-2026-october-24-2026/
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/rocky-horror-picture-show
 -2026-04-09-2026-18-25-58
