BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Goosebumps The Musical: Phantom of the Auditorium
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T200000
UID:47c0a51509b9a7eede133ec1f79f5596@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/7138
 c07/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x2400+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffe%2F47%2F171f49ba45d8be
 4627e8ac726cf0%2Fsq-goosebumps-2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Constellation Stage + Screen\nConstellation Stage
  & Screen presents “R.L. Stine's Goosebumps The Musical: Phantom of the 
 Auditorium” on stage October 30-November 15 at the Waldron Auditorium.\n
  Get ready for a frightfully fun adventure with Goosebumps The Musical\, b
 ased on the wildly popular books by R. L. Stine! When Brooke and Zeke are 
 cast in their school’s spooky new play\, The Phantom\, they start to won
 der if the show is actually cursed. As strange messages appear and rehears
 als are disrupted by a mysterious masked figure\, they must uncover the tr
 uth: is it all an elaborate prank… or is their theater truly haunted? Fu
 ll of catchy songs\, laugh-out-loud moments\, and just the right amount of
  Halloween-season chills\, this musical mystery is perfect for kids\, twee
 ns\, and grown-ups who remember reading by flashlight. Fun for all ages! \
 n See Constellation’s website for more information\, including a detaile
 d performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstell
 ation.org/kids/goosebumps/\nTickets: https://seeconstellation.org/kids/goo
 sebumps/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium\, 122 S Walnut St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 4
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/goosebumps-the-musical-ph
 antom-of-the-auditorium-24-08-2026-10-36-20
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Future Tense 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T160000
UID:b7c4ad8d66d2538043eeea9d6bfdfd44@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/67b8
 488/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1536+0+0/resize/254x203!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F50%2F68%2Fd9a7e48247dfb7
 8b479749e07c8e%2Fallanson-audrey-cb.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Grunwald Gallery of Art\nThe Grunwald Gallery of 
 Art at Indiana University Bloomington partners with Surface Design Associa
 tion to present "Future Tense 2026"—a national student exhibition juried
  by José Santiago Pérez. Since 2017\, Surface Design Association (SDA) h
 as invited students to submit work for the annual Juried Student Exhibitio
 n. The ninth iteration of this exhibition will be held at Indiana Universi
 ty’s Grunwald Gallery of Art in Bloomington\, IN\, from August 25-Octobe
 r 31\, 2026. Exhibiting artists are eligible for four awards recognizing e
 xcellence in artistic practice. \n "Future Tense” celebrates the creativ
 e work of student artists\, designers\, and makers working with\, or inspi
 red by fiber\, or textile materials\, or techniques. This exhibition offer
 s a glimpse into the future of contemporary fibers by presenting the very 
 best work being made by students in the field today. \n Opening reception:
  Friday\, September 4\, 6-8 pm\, Grunwald Gallery\n Juror's Remarks and Aw
 ards: Friday\, September 4\, 6:30 pm\, Grunwald Gallery\n Regular Gallery 
 Hours: Tuesday - Saturday\, 12 pm - 4 pm
LOCATION:Grunwald Gallery of Art\, 1201 E Seventh Street\, Bloomington\, I
 ndiana 47405
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/future-tense-2026-09-09-2
 026-15-02-14
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
