 y into a performance filled with warmth and joy.\n Under the direction of 
 Dr. Chris Albanese\, the Singing Hoosiers will deliver their signature hig
 h-energy performance alongside heartfelt musical moments that capture the 
 magic of the holidays. From sparkling ensemble numbers to moving vocal sho
 wcases\, Holiday Chimes is the perfect way to get into the holiday spirit.
 \nTickets: https://www.iuauditorium.com/events/detail/chimes-2026
